            10. Common Mistakes to Avoid
          </h2>

          <div class="space-y-6 my-8">
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Buying the Brand Instead of the Model</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                A brand's firm foam bed and its plush hybrid are different products. Choose the firmness and construction first, then compare brands.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Assuming the Store Bed and the Box Bed Are the Same</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Sealy Dreamlife and Serta Sleeptrue are separate online lines from the brands' showroom mattresses. Compare their specs, not their names.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Ordering From an Unauthorized Seller</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                A brand's trial and warranty may not apply to a third-party seller. On Amazon, buy from the brand's storefront or from Amazon itself.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Comparing Trials by Headline Length Alone</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                A 365-night trial with a 30-night minimum and a 100-night trial with a 21-night minimum both give you weeks to decide. Read the minimum stay and the return process too.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Paying Premium Prices for a Guest Bed</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                A mattress used a few nights a month does not need a premium brand. A budget brand like Zinus or Linenspa is the sensible choice there; spend the difference on the bed you sleep on every night.
              </p>
            </div>
